    old "She kept repeating the words, over and over again."
    new "그녀는 그 말을 계속해서 반복했다."

    old "She felt Jaeid wrap his strong arms around her, pulling her into an embrace."
    new "그녀는 자이드가 강한 팔로 자신을 감싸 안으며 끌어당기는 것을 느꼈다."

    old "And she wept."
    new "그녀는 눈물을 흘렸다."

    old "She held back nothing from him anymore as she cried into his chest."
